# Device reports are deliberately NOT committed. This repo is public, and a
# phone screenshot is whatever was on screen at that moment — a home screen, a
# notification, a personal photo. That is not something to publish by accident,
# and a blob survives in git history long after the file is deleted.
#
# snap.sh / snap.ps1 leave reports on disk to be attached directly instead.
